<style>
    body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .flowchart {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .step,
    .decision {
        border: 1px solid #000;
        padding: 15px;
        text-align: center;
        width: 250px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background-color: #A9A9A9;
        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .step:hover,
    .decision:hover {
        background-color: #ffffff;
    }

    .step-content {
        transform: scale(0);
        opacity: 0;
        transition: transform 0.5s ease,
        opacity 0.5s ease;
    }

    .step:hover .step-content {
        transform: scale(1);
        opacity: 1;
    }

    .connector {
        width: 2px;
        height: 40px;
        background: #000;
    }

    .decision {
        width: 370px;
        height: 370px;
        transform: rotate(45deg);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        position: relative;
        margin: 40px 0;
    }

    .decision-inner {
        transform: rotate(-45deg);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        width: 300px;
        position: relative;
    }


    .decision-title {
        width: 300px;
    }

    .decision-content {
        transform: rotate(-45deg) scale(0);
        opacity: 0;
        transition: transform 0.5s ease,
        opacity 0.5s ease;
        width: 300px;
    }

    .decision:hover .decision-content {
        transform: scale(1);
        opacity: 1;
    }

    .h-line,
    .v-line {
        position: absolute;
        background: #000;
    }

    .parent {
        position: relative;
    }

    .h-line {
        width: 100px;
        height: 2px;
        background: black;
    }

    .h-line.left {
        top: -227px;
        left: calc(50% + 257px);
    }

    .h-line.right {
        top: -227px;
        right: calc(50% + 257px);
    }

    .v-line {
        width: 1px;
        height: 450px;
        top: -227px;
    }

    .v-line.left {
        left: calc(50% - 358px);
    }

    .v-line.right {
        right: calc(50% - 358px);
    }

    .h1-line {
        position: absolute;
        height: 2px;
        width: 234px;
        background: #000;
        top: 223px;
    }

    .h1-line.left {
        left: calc(50% - 358px);
    }

    .h1-line.right {
        right: calc(50% - 358px);
    }

    .label {
        position: absolute;
        writing-mode: vertical-rl;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 40px;
        line-height: 1.2;
        top: -50px;
    }

    .label.left {
        left: calc(55% - 430px);
        transform: rotate(180deg);
    }

    .label.right {
        right: calc(55% - 430px);
    }

    .bottom-step {
        margin-top: 160px;
    }

    .decision-content .sub-heading {
        font-weight: 600;
        display: inline;
    }
</style>
<h1 class="fw-bold">Our Approach</h1>
<br/>

<p class="fw-lighter text-muted">
    Here’s how we scope, price, and deliver work—from the first
    conversation to the final invoice.
</p>
<br/>
<div class="flowchart">
    <!-- Top step -->
    <div class="step">
        <strong>1 - Scope</strong>
        <div class="step-content">
            Each engagement starts with a Scope of Work (SOW)—a shared
            understanding of what we’re solving.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="connector"></div>

    <!-- Middle step -->
    <div class="step">
        <strong>2 - Estimate</strong><br/>
        <div class="step-content">
            Each UOW is estimated in Full Stack Days (FSDs): one day of
            coordinated output from a core contributor and supporting
            team, rather than just an average (blended) rate. You’ll see
            your entire project—scope, delivery, and cost—measured in
            the same unit.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="connector"></div>

    <!-- Diamond -->
    <div class="decision">
        <div class="decision-inner">
            <div class="decision-title">
                <strong>3 - Choose Pricing Model</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="decision-content">
                <span class="sub-heading">Fixed Billing:</span><br/>
                Pay the upper bound of our estimate (the pessimistic case).
                You cap risk and lock in a known cost.
                <br/><br/>
                <span class="sub-heading">Flexible Billing:</span><br/>
                Pay only for the actual FSDs used. If a UOW takes less time,
                you pay less. If it takes more, you’re billed only for what
                was actually consumed.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Branch lines -->
    <div class="parent">
        <div class="h-line left"></div>
        <div class="h-line right"></div>

        <div class="v-line left"></div>
        <div class="v-line right"></div>

        <div class="label left">Fixed</div>
        <div class="label right">Flexible</div>

        <div class="h1-line left"></div>
        <div class="h1-line right"></div>
    </div>
    <!-- Bottom step -->
    <div class="step bottom-step">
        <strong>4 - Deliver</strong><br/>
        <div class="step-content">
            Every month, you get a clear invoice—our line items are
            deliverables (UOWs), not resources.
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
